fixture zone1_02_control_carry_jump
doc Control for tech 2, from the second task-3 review: the farthest route without a ground dash-jump that a search over every tick found (docs/adr/0010). A ground dash runs flat past the edge (a ground dash does not fall), a coyote jump on dash frame 10 (a carry-over frame, not the dash-jump's 5 to 9) keeps only the carry's 10 u/f but keeps it all the way, then the air dash and, on its frame 9, the air jump: an air dash-jump, which keeps the air dash's 20 u/f (the third review: a jump on any dash's frames 5 to 9 is a dash-jump). Its feet reach 1539 u past the edge at the ledge's height and it falls into the 1664 u chasm: crossing takes a ground dash-jump.
room zone1/02_dash_jump
# The inputs of tests/replay/tech/tech02_control_carry_jump.fixture, 576 u right and 224 u down: room 02's chasm is test/chasm's (tests/unit/tools/test_gap_reach_room.gd).
spawn 985 608
frames 170
input
  0 R dash
  1..8 R
  9..43 R jump
  44 R jump dash
  45..50 R jump
  51 R
  52..169 R jump
end
expect
  # No jump on the ground dash's frames 5 to 9: this is not the ground dash-jump.
  never 4..8 event.jump=1
  # A coyote ground jump on a carry-over frame, at the carry's 10 u/f.
  at 9 event.jump=1 event.air_jump=0 vx=2560 state=air
  at 44 event.dash=1
  # The air jump on the air dash's frame 9: an air dash-jump at 20 u/f.
  at 52 event.air_jump=1 vx=5120
  mark below 10..169 y>618u
  at below x<2720u
  never 0..169 x>=2720u ground=1
end
